Gettext: the gettext API of native language support, with libintl of
the package az.

The module gettext of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/gettext.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/gettext.
